        "subject": "🎉 YKS KAFA Premium Aktif! Ödemen Alındı",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #f8f9fa;\">\n  <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); padding: 40px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: white; margin: 0;\">🎉 Ödemen Alındı!</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #e0e7ff;\">YKS KAFA Premium artık aktif</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 30px; background: white; margin: 20px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin-top:0; color: #1f2937;\">Premium hesabın hazır! 🚀</h2>\n    <div style=\"background: #f0fdf4; border: 2px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n      <table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n        <tr><td style=\"color:#555; padding:4px 0;\"><strong>Plan:</strong></td><td>{{ $('Aktivasyon Verisi Hazırla').item.json.plan === 'premium_yillik' ? 'Yıllık Premium' : '6 Aylık Premium' }}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"color:#555; padding:4px 0;\"><strong>Tutar:</strong></td><td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">{{ $('Aktivasyon Verisi Hazırla').item.json.tutar }} TL</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"color:#555; padding:4px 0;\"><strong>Ödeme No:</strong></td><td style=\"font-family:monospace;\">{{ $('Aktivasyon Verisi Hazırla').item.json.paymentId }}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"color:#555; padding:4px 0;\"><strong>Geçerlilik:</strong></td><td>{{ new Date($('Aktivasyon Verisi Hazırla').item.json.abonelik_bitis).toLocaleDateString('tr-TR') }} tarihine kadar</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background: #f0f0ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; margin: 15px 0;\">\n      <h3 style=\"color: #6366f1; margin-top: 0;\">Premium Avantajların:</h3>\n      <p>✅ Sınırsız soru çözme &nbsp; ✅ GPT-4o yapay zeka desteği</p>\n      <p>✅ Detaylı performans analizi &nbsp; ✅ Tüm TYT & AYT dersleri</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;\">\n      <a href=\"https://ykskafa.com/dashb